aude Code, Codex, or any coding agent that can run `pwc`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## How a clone run works"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Capture the live URL (integrity-checked, assets localized)\n2. Plan the real page sections\n3. Auth"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"or clean React for every section\n4. Assemble and build\n5. Score fingerprints, weight, and visual mat"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ch\n6. Repair the worst section, rebuild, re-measure\n7. Hand you a local preview: `ready_for_user_rev"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"iew` or `failed_with_residuals`"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"If the page is WebGL, runtime canvas, or scroll-choreographed, that ceiling is reported up front. Co"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ntent still clones; the runtime-drawn look may not."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## CLI"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Every command prints JSON. `ok` is the only pass/fail that matters."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

